    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Zak Group is a London-based graphic design and identity studio founded in 2005 by Zak Kyes. Nine-person team as of 2025: Kyes (Creative Director, ex-Art Director at the Architectural Association), Belle Place (Director), Cedar Pasori (Strategy Director), Chi-Long Trieu (Type Director), two designers, a developer, and a studio manager. Clients include Comme des Garcons, Nike, Prada, Chanel, Phaidon, Anne Imhof; strong arts and culture positioning with commercial luxury crossover. Practice spans identity systems, publication design, creative direction, brand strategy, and digital/web work. Senior studio, roughly 20 years operating, highly regarded in cultural design circles. Autonomy 4: established studio with a defined creative director, full project ownership expected; not quite a 5 because they are a collaborating studio rather than a singular autonomous voice. IG context shot queued (state/ig-queue.json): profile returned error page logged-out.",
